% besttictactoe
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from besttictactoe.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=besttictactoe
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move mark with *a board*, *an index* and *a second index* is made; known as mark.

the fluents are:
    *a board* cell *an index* with *a second index* with *a thing*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* col *a second thing* with *a third thing*; known as col.
    *a thing* is the diag of *a second thing*; known as diag.
    the move mark with *a board*, *an index* and *a second index* is legal; known as legal_mark.
    open; known as open.
    *a thing* row *a second thing* with *a third thing*; known as row.
    *a thing* is a line; known as line.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.

the knowledge base besttictactoe includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/besttictactoe.hrf".

the move mark with a board, an index and a second index is legal at a time if
    the board cell the index with the second index with b at the time.

the goal of x is 100 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 100 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 0 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

a thing row a second thing with a third thing at a time if
    the thing cell the second thing with 1 with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 2 with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 3 with the third thing at the time.

a thing col a second thing with a third thing at a time if
    the thing cell 1 with the second thing with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell 2 with the second thing with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell 3 with the second thing with the third thing at the time.

a thing is the diag of a second thing at a time if
    the thing cell 1 with 1 with the second thing at the time
    and the thing cell 2 with 2 with the second thing at the time
    and the thing cell 3 with 3 with the second thing at the time.

a thing is the diag of a second thing at a time if
    the thing cell 1 with 3 with the second thing at the time
    and the thing cell 2 with 2 with the second thing at the time
    and the thing cell 3 with 1 with the second thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    al row a second thing with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    be row a second thing with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    al col a second thing with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    be col a second thing with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    al is the diag of the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    be is the diag of the thing at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    x is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    o is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that open at the time.

open at a time if
    a board cell an index with a second index with b at the time.

when the move mark with a board, an index and a second index is made
    and a role is a control
then the board cell the index with the second index with the role
    and it is not the case that the board cell the index with the second index with b.

when the move mark with a board, an index and a second index is made
    and x is a control
then o is a control
    and it is not the case that x is a control.

when the move mark with a board, an index and a second index is made
    and o is a control
then x is a control
    and it is not the case that o is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move mark with a board, an index and a second index is made
    and it is not the case that the move mark with the board, the index and the second index is legal.

initially al cell 1 with 1 with b
    and al cell 1 with 2 with b
    and al cell 1 with 3 with b
    and al cell 2 with 1 with b
    and al cell 2 with 2 with b
    and al cell 2 with 3 with b
    and al cell 3 with 1 with b
    and al cell 3 with 2 with b
    and al cell 3 with 3 with b
    and be cell 1 with 1 with b
    and be cell 1 with 2 with b
    and be cell 1 with 3 with b
    and be cell 2 with 1 with b
    and be cell 2 with 2 with b
    and be cell 2 with 3 with b
    and be cell 3 with 1 with b
    and be cell 3 with 2 with b
    and be cell 3 with 3 with b
    and x is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - control(x)
%   - cell(al,1,1,x)
%   - cell(al,1,2,x)
%   - cell(al,1,3,o)
%   - cell(al,2,1,o)
%   - cell(al,2,2,b)
%   - cell(al,2,3,b)
%   - cell(al,3,1,b)
%   - cell(al,3,2,o)
%   - cell(al,3,3,o)
%   - cell(be,1,1,o)
%   - cell(be,1,2,x)
%   - cell(be,1,3,b)
%   - cell(be,2,1,x)
%   - cell(be,2,2,o)
%   - cell(be,2,3,b)
%   - cell(be,3,1,x)
%   - cell(be,3,2,x)
%   - cell(be,3,3,b)
scenario play is:
    the move mark with al, 1 and 1 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move mark with al, 3 and 3 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move mark with be, 3 and 2 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move mark with al, 3 and 2 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move mark with al, 1 and 2 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move mark with be, 2 and 2 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move mark with be, 1 and 2 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move mark with be, 1 and 1 is made from 8 to 9.
    the move mark with be, 2 and 1 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move mark with al, 1 and 3 is made from 10 to 11.
    the move mark with be, 3 and 1 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move mark with al, 2 and 1 is made from 12 to 13.

